<section class="pp-section pp-section-soft">
        <div class="container">
            <div class="custom-faq-accordion">
                <div class="custom-faq-accordion" aria-label="Frequently Asked Questions"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question open" type="button" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="faq-answer-0"><span class="faq-title"><h3>How does the WhatsApp API White Label Reseller system work?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-0" class="faq-answer open" role="region" aria-hidden="false" style="max-height:none;">The white label reseller engages you with an official WhatsApp BSP. Resellers can create and manage client accounts through the White label panel. They can even set their own cost, send bulk messages, and track analytics. It’s the right tool for marketing agencies, bulk SMS providers, and CRM companies.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-1"><span class="faq-title"><h3>What are the benefits of becoming a WhatsApp API White Label Reseller?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-1" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">The important benefits a White label reseller can achieve are their own branding using the domain and logo. Complete control over cost and profit, centralized API dashboard to manage users, and access to features such as chatbot builder, template approvals, and bulk messaging.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-2"><span class="faq-title"><h3>Is a white label reseller WhatsApp panel fit for bulk messaging?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-2" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">Yes, a White label reseller panel caters to bulk messaging campaigns. The panel allows use in marketing promotions, alerts, and updates to a number of customers using advanced features, including message templates, scheduled sending, and performance tracking of campaigns.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-3"><span class="faq-title"><h3>Can I integrate the reseller panel with CRM or third-party tools?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-3" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">Yes, the reseller panel can be integrated with CRM or third-party tools. Many white label panels provide CRM integration and webhook support, ensuring automated and efficient conversation workflows.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-4"><span class="faq-title"><h3>Is a registered business required to use the reseller panel?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-4" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">No, you do not have to register your business to use a white label reseller panel. You can run the service under your brand name. However, certain legal and financial requirements may apply based on your region and business operations.</div></div><div class="faq-item"><button class="faq-question" type="button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-answer-5"><span class="faq-title"><h3>Can we offer chatbot services with the white label WhatsApp API?</h3></span><span class="faq-arrow" aria-hidden="true"></span></button><div id="faq-answer-5" class="faq-answer" role="region" aria-hidden="true">Yes, you can offer chatbot services with the white label WhatsApp API. It allows you to resell a complete chatbot solution under your branding to your clients.</div></div></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"How does the WhatsApp API White Label Reseller system work?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The white label reseller engages you with an official WhatsApp BSP. Resellers can create and manage client accounts through the White label panel. They can even set their own cost, send bulk messages, and track analytics. It’s the right tool for marketing agencies, bulk SMS providers, and CRM companies."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What are the benefits of becoming a WhatsApp API White Label Reseller?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The important benefits a White label reseller can achieve are their own branding using the domain and logo. Complete control over cost and profit, centralized API dashboard to manage users, and access to features such as chatbot builder, template approvals, and bulk messaging."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a white label reseller WhatsApp panel fit for bulk messaging?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, a White label reseller panel caters to bulk messaging campaigns. The panel allows use in marketing promotions, alerts, and updates to a number of customers using advanced features, including message templates, scheduled sending, and performance tracking of campaigns."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can I integrate the reseller panel with CRM or third-party tools?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, the reseller panel can be integrated with CRM or third-party tools. Many white label panels provide CRM integration and webhook support, ensuring automated and efficient conversation workflows."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Is a registered business required to use the reseller panel?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"No, you do not have to register your business to use a white label reseller panel. You can run the service under your brand name. However, certain legal and financial requirements may apply based on your region and business operations."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can we offer chatbot services with the white label WhatsApp API?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes, you can offer chatbot services with the white label WhatsApp API. It allows you to resell a complete chatbot solution under your branding to your clients."}}]}</script>
    <script>
    (function(){
        if (window.__customFaqAccordionInit) return;
        window.__customFaqAccordionInit = true;

        function closeAnswer(answer, btn) {
            if (!answer) return;
            // if maxHeight is "none", set to current px value to animate to 0
            if (answer.style.maxHeight === "none" || answer.style.maxHeight === "") {
                answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + "px";
            }
            // force reflow
            void answer.offsetHeight;
            answer.style.maxHeight = "0px";
            answer.classList.remove("open");
            if (btn) {
                btn.classList.remove("open");
                btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
            }
            answer.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "true");
        }

        function openAnswer(answer, btn) {
            if (!answer) return;
            // set to exact height so transition works
            answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + "px";
            answer.classList.add("open");
            if (btn) {
                btn.classList.add("open");
                btn.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "true");
            }
            answer.setAttribute("aria-hidden", "false");

            // once transition finishes, set to none to allow internal content changes (images) without clipping
            var onTransEnd = function(e){
                if (answer.classList.contains("open")) {
                    answer.style.maxHeight = "none";
                }
                answer.removeEventListener("transitionend", onTransEnd);
            };
            answer.addEventListener("transitionend", onTransEnd);
        }

        document.addEventListener("click", function(e){
            var btn = e.target.closest ? e.target.closest(".custom-faq-accordion .faq-question") : null;
            if (!btn) return;

            var item = btn.closest(".faq-item");
            if (!item) return;
            var answer = item.querySelector(".faq-answer");
            if (!answer) return;

            // if already open, close it
            if (answer.classList.contains("open")) {
                closeAnswer(answer, btn);
            } else {
                // optionally close other open items (uncomment to allow only-one-open)
                var openItems = document.querySelectorAll(".custom-faq-accordion .faq-answer.open");
                openItems.forEach(function(o){
                    var parentBtn = o.closest(".faq-item") ? o.closest(".faq-item").querySelector(".faq-question") : null;
                    if (o !== answer) closeAnswer(o, parentBtn);
                });

                openAnswer(answer, btn);
            }
        });

        // Make sure open answers recalc height on window resize (useful if images load or layout changes)
        window.addEventListener("resize", function(){
            var openAnswers = document.querySelectorAll(".custom-faq-accordion .faq-answer.open");
            openAnswers.forEach(function(a){
                // if maxHeight is "none", set it to scrollHeight to keep it visible after resize
                if (a.style.maxHeight === "none") {
                    a.style.maxHeight = a.scrollHeight + "px";
                    // then release to none after a tick
                    setTimeout(function(){ a.style.maxHeight = "none"; }, 350);
                }
            });
        });
    })();
    </script>
    
